# Only track blog-src on gh-pages branch
# Everything else in workspace is managed by rsync/openclaw
*.py
*.db
*.json
*.md
!blog-src/**
__pycache__/
workers/
tasks/
tests/
context/
skills/
vault/
memory/
blog-src/node_modules/
blog-src/dist/
blog-src/.astro/

# Marvin-owned governance files — tracked so he can edit them on GitHub.
# The cairn-maintenance reminder links here; before this they were ignored,
# so that link 404'd. IDEAS.md and references/ stay ignored: Jimbo rewrites
# them every run and tracking them only invites pull conflicts.
!meta/CHARTER.md
!meta/BLACKLIST.md
!meta/TASTE.md
